      "status": "IR; Week 7 OUT",
      "excerpt": "Oct. 25 Marist Liufau #35 OLB Height: 6-2 Weight: 238 lbs College: Notre Dame 12:21 -- Despite opening the practice window this week for both players, the Cowboys have ruled out Marist Liufau and P.J. Locke for this week's game in Philly. Liufau (wrist) and Locke (foot) are both still on IR-designated for return but were able to practice this week after the Cowboys opened the 21-day window. Still, neither player seems ready enough for action against the Eagles on Monday night. But with the Cowboys coming back on a short week to prepare for Arizona on Nov. 1, it's likely both players could have a chance to return for that. The Cowboys would have to create two spots for them on the 53-man roster. ------------------ "
